Package: poisk
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Fast native application launcher and command palette for Pantheon and Linux
 Poisk is a fast, keyboard-centric application launcher and productivity palette
 for Linux with first-class elementary OS (Pantheon) and GNOME Shell support.
 Written with Vala, GTK4, Libadwaita, and Granite 7.
